  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d4304f56-d292-529b-a151-6fcc55b3e204" activityNameId="0786eff8-06f2-5c31-8a37-5a27fc43e505" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tetrahydrofuran, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tetrahydrofuran, at plant
The process "tetrahydrofuran, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of tetrahydrofuran from 1,4-butanediol  in Europe. Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with literature data. The emissions are estimated. Infrastrucxture and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000109-99-9; 
Formula: C4H8O; 
Synonyms: tetramethylene oxide, oxolane; 
UUID: 415be480-7d95-305d-9f33-814c22d6cc14
Production of tetrahydrofuran including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Cyclation of 1,4-butanediol
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: Total production in the world  is around 230.000 tons.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_415be480-7d95-305d-9f33-814c22d6cc14.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
